{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/the-lana-residences-omniyat-business-bay","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":547,"crm_id":"351","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"The Lana Residences","slug":"the-lana-residences-omniyat-business-bay","display_address":"Business Bay","building_type":["apartment","penthouse","branded"],"completion_year":"Ready","developer":"Omniyat","price":85000000,"display_price":"85M","lattitude":25.187688,"longitude":55.2853806,"min_bedrooms":2,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>The Lana Residences, Dorchester Collection is an exceptional luxury development by Dubai’s visionary developer, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-omniyat/\">Omniyat</a>, located in the prestigious Marasi Bay. The project comprises two elegantly interconnected towers resting on a grand podium. One tower is home to a world-class hotel, while the other features an exclusive selection of high-end residences—including <strong>2 to 4-bedroom apartments, 4-bedroom duplexes, and 4- to 5-bedroom penthouses</strong> with private Jacuzzis and expansive terraces. The podium level is dedicated to upscale cafés, fine dining restaurants, and leisure amenities reserved solely for residents.</p><p>Designed in collaboration with the renowned Parisian design house Gilles &amp; Boissier, the architecture and interiors of The Lana Residences exude timeless sophistication. The façade and interior spaces are adorned with premium materials, elegant finishes, and bespoke design details. Each residence is thoughtfully crafted with flowing layouts, private balconies or terraces, and custom-designed furniture in light, natural tones—creating an atmosphere of refined calm and understated luxury.</p><p>As part of the iconic Dorchester Collection, The Lana Residences at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/business-bay/\">Business Bay</a> delivers an unmatched lifestyle experience. Residents enjoy access to a curated selection of five-star hotel services, including dedicated concierge, 24-hour security with surveillance, valet parking, housekeeping, and butler service. World-class amenities include a modern fitness centre, yoga studio, tranquil spa, outdoor swimming pool, and lush landscaped gardens.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_77afdb3488.jpg","hash":"The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_77afdb3488","name":"The Lana Residences by Omniyat"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_c8b9210c06.jpg","hash":"The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_c8b9210c06","name":"The Lana Residences by Omniyat"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_4838b42aed.jpg","hash":"The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_4838b42aed","name":"The Lana Residences by Omniyat"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_fcbfe9f791.jpg","hash":"The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_fcbfe9f791","name":"The Lana Residences by Omniyat"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_8b594f3d56.jpg","hash":"The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_8b594f3d56","name":"The Lana Residences by Omniyat"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_72f371f9c4.jpg","hash":"The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_72f371f9c4","name":"The Lana Residences by Omniyat"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_8cc8c1c5c7.jpg","hash":"The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_8cc8c1c5c7","name":"The Lana Residences by Omniyat"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_636fed5606.jpg","hash":"The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_636fed5606","name":"The Lana Residences by Omniyat"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_8f1c9df42c.jpg","hash":"The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_8f1c9df42c","name":"The Lana Residences by Omniyat"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_a8eef9620a.jpg","hash":"The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_a8eef9620a","name":"The Lana Residences by Omniyat"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_b29d2fcb72.jpg","hash":"The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_b29d2fcb72","name":"The Lana Residences by Omniyat"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_87fd57c77e.jpg","hash":"The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_87fd57c77e","name":"The Lana Residences by Omniyat"}],"images":null,"characteristics_module":{"id":1444,"cta":{"id":2221,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Find out more","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#register-interest"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_07e8f161df.jpg","hash":"The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_07e8f161df","name":"The Lana Residences by Omniyat"},"style":null,"title":"Opulent Living at The Lana Residences, Dorchester Collection, Dubai","heading":"Unique Selling Points","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Ultra-Exclusive Living: Limited to only 39 bespoke residences including simplex, duplex, and penthouse configurations.</li><li>Managed by Dorchester Collection: A legendary name in hospitality offering five-star hotel services for everyday living.</li><li>Waterfront Location: Situated at the prestigious Marasi Bay Marina, offering tranquil waterfront views and unmatched privacy.</li><li>Architectural Brilliance: Designed by the iconic Foster + Partners with interiors by Gilles &amp; Boissier, combining timeless sophistication and modern artistry.</li><li>Private Amenities: Includes an outdoor pool with views of Downtown Dubai, private gym and yoga studio, residents’ lounge, dining and event spaces.</li><li>Sky Penthouses: Spanning up to 17,700 sq. ft., these top-floor penthouses feature private pools, terraces, and panoramic city and marina views.</li><li>Generous Living Spaces: Residences range from 3,900 to 10,000+ sq. ft., offering open layouts, double-height ceilings, and expansive terraces.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1445,"cta":{"id":2222,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_f425aa0b87.jpg","hash":"The_Lana_Residences_by_Omniyat_f425aa0b87","name":"The Lana Residences by Omniyat"},"style":null,"title":"Prime Location – The Lana Residences, Marasi Bay Marina","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Perfectly positioned in the heart of Marasi Bay Marina, The Lana Residences, Dorchester Collection, Dubai enjoys a coveted waterfront location in the Burj Khalifa District. This iconic address places residents within moments of Downtown Dubai’s cultural landmarks, luxury retail, and fine dining, all while offering the serenity of marina-front living. With effortless access to major business hubs and lifestyle destinations, the location bridges privacy and prestige—redefining what it means to live at the centre of it all.</p><ul><li>Burj Khalifa / Downtown Dubai – 5 minutes</li><li>Dubai Mall – 7 minutes</li><li>DIFC (Dubai International Financial Centre) – 10 minutes</li><li>City Walk – 10 minutes</li><li>